{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And you shall despoil the Egyptians.</b> Even though you will receive everything from them by way of request, and you will be obligated to return it, behold you will subsequently acquire it all legitimately, when they pursue you to make war against you and to seize your spoil. For indeed, when they died in that battle — since YHWH waged the battle — it was just, measure for measure, that all the pursuers' spoil become the pursued's, as is the custom in every war."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:17.781710898Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}